    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:853f135a6ee1ccb9727e595b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我心急地蒙混了过去，\n但是菱亚马逊似乎没有接受我的说法……\n那天，训练就那样结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "353da5fb1804d923058f7a441fe7df482b41298e7f5222d74b8197a5c0c1a759",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012104.json",
