    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa8b27620669d3086f7ec47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练公！今天的训练取消了！\n要改成进行模拟赛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225a023ac67534c7b8ec0077b536ed9317b210335d9842d240acdaa066566d1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:755dba99681c1324977f2920",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊的成长令人相当惊艳。\n我觉得她已经十分接近自己设下的目标。\n然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5214718edcf6ffaf38cda12324dd5dd13b2d4b9a90948659f52b46a8e8fd9cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b69c4c71f6a3443ac7e1079",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46e1b1d0b91c1ce1fa11c6823587aa41504c815d8da191f269c6fd336b6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012104.json",
      "json_path": [
